      "value": "B-SCHUB - BACnet Secure Connect Hub"
    },
    "productDescription": {
      "provenance": "user-entered",
      "value": "A BACnet Secure Connect hub built on the CAS BACnet Stack. BACnet/SC devices connect to it over TLS 1.3 WebSockets with mutual certificate authentication, and it relays their traffic. It can also connect out to another hub as a node (--sc-hub-uri). A BACnet/IP port for discovery and management is available when it is started with --port. Its certificates can be replaced over BACnet with the BACnet/SC certificate procedures."
    },
    "productName": {
